<title>USA: Tultex increases size of stock buy back.</title>
<headline>Tultex increases size of stock buy back.</headline>
<dateline>MARTINSVILLE, Va. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tultex Corp said Thursday it has increased a stock purchase program by 250,000 shares to one million.</p>
<p>The company said that as of October 31, it had purchased 497,800 shares.</p>
<p>Tultex, a marketer and manufacturer of clothing, said the shares may be purchased from time to time on the New York Stock Exchange or in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>It did not give a reason for increasing the size of the buy back.</p>
</text>
